OL,3,ASterling given suspended sentence for  
OL,4,Adangerous driving                      
OL,6,FFormer England footballer Raheem       
OL,7,FSterling has been given a suspended    
OL,8,Fsentence after admitting dangerously   
OL,9,Fdriving his Lamborghini while inhaling 
OL,10,Fnitrous oxide from a balloon on a      
OL,11,Fmotorway.                              
OL,13,FThe 31-year-old, from Berkshire, who   
OL,14,Flater crashed into a metal gate during 
OL,15,Frush hour, gave no reaction as he was  
OL,16,Fhanded a 12-month jail term, suspended 
OL,17,Ffor 18 months, at Basingstoke          
OL,18,FMagistrates' Court.                    
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
