OL,3,ASterling given suspended sentence for  
OL,4,Adangerous driving                      
OL,6,FSterling had pleaded guilty to         
OL,7,Fdangerous driving of a Lamborghini Urus
OL,8,Fand possessing nitrous oxide on the    
OL,9,FM25, the M3, the A327 and Minley Road  
OL,10,Fon 28 May.                             
OL,12,FThe judge said Sterling's use of the   
OL,13,FClass C drug had became a "maladaptive 
OL,14,Fcoping mechanism during a difficult    
OL,15,Fperiod" in his career.                 
